# evidence-for: US-006, AC-022, AC-025, FR-018, FR-020, FR-021, FR-031, FR-012
#
# AC-022 / FR-018 / FR-031. APP_DEBUG is read only through os.getenv in the
# fixture's src/app/main.py and is reported in surface.config with undeclared
# true, beside the two os.environ reads.
#
# AC-025 / FR-020 / FR-021. The fixture carries a pyproject.toml and no
# package.json, so name and description come from [project] and the one
# [project.scripts] entry lands in surface.cli anchored to pyproject.toml:1.
#
# FR-012. The last two lines are the anchor rule the comment beside
# CLI_FLAG_DECL states: every entry under surface and user_surface carries one,
# and the tooling array is the one that carries none. The sentence used to claim
# the whole document.
